{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94f081bc2dd1e97a577092aa50cce669be0ff8460791aa84ea76d54eb022ed1e",
      "text": "开始转动的三根指针",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ab2e495716d29bafd74ccb2d0793add6a5f00a31e740943ee3698fd8a3437b",
      "text": "参加试镜的想乐和克里斯。制作人确信了两人作为偶像的魅力，然而在会场上，却没有看到此前遇到的雨彦的身影。这时克里斯等人，出人意料地讲起了一件奇妙的事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94f081bc2dd1e97a577092aa50cce669be0ff8460791aa84ea76d54eb022ed1e",
      "text": "开始转动的三根指针",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57435e1ed9e97502264f08d2528869e5fb9c4cd98772fe1080622031f43ce149",
      "text": "数分钟前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c348f6f2d43ec62f4333ef4e39c5cfcfbad025161910e49922ec129a584a0f79",
      "text": "……启程赴艺途，其中尽是甘与苦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1803fe5687105dea41aefdef6e868e7a96f705212f44b2deca880896d3c5cd76",
      "text": "（终于到了试镜当天啊～。还有一点\n时间，复习一下收到的资料吧……啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc18549225fbece14ffaf519e73bfe60fda81e435a15b28514d4a7324a2db68b",
      "text": "请。……哎呀？这份资料是……您也是\n来参加今天的试镜的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c41bf829a749934eef9f8c1feb97c5e52dd4da3700ce86df70e0e18517e4de1f",
      "text": "谢谢你～\n是的，没错哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f807069eaa6a67f41252200bfc6c5c60e8f4f4417c9947bc0d36c7a9c1bfb130",
      "text": "（……“您也是”也就是说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:974b3ef1b7047d9bb8814ff231bd41696db144e77915f3c18641c2d3d794287b",
      "text": "（这个人也是试镜的参加者啊～。\n长相相当标致呢，说不定是个强敌～？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63462962b8932aa25b2bc7233f844b394a5779d4fb6e4920aaf7cb1040e424c7",
      "text": "莫非，您在紧张吗？我也一样呢。\n如果可以的话，要不要闲聊几句一起放松一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dac7ed506dbdbebc689f694bd3e821700669095f073bdc1de16ba681de6f8c7",
      "text": "好啊，请……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0a19388a792d31f11e7f0490682adcb473e85c1eefca9bb1592e57777572e0b",
      "text": "谈话主题就定为……对了！\n聊聊彼此“深爱之物”，意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bfec7e0b9e7639164f97a37ec0fc58fd555121bdd6f49f51db8c749064a91b6",
      "text": "……“深爱之物”，是吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee656b65c16489d8366b0de0fb67c9ff32844f2c8c5d008f1bad43fc131fc2bc",
      "text": "是的！那么首先，\n就由先提出来的我开始说起吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7199f320579aac1d5f975f2a3e336e0bd921a6106466837e608202373c54c87",
      "text": "我献上坚定不移的爱之物……那就是，大海！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
